# Working media — source rolls, extracted audio, editor renders.
# GitLab rejects >100MiB blobs; these stay on disk / IPFS. Published assets that
# pages already reference remain tracked (fat-repo rule — docs/MEDIA_AND_IPFS.md).
**/VID_*.mp4
**/*.mp4
**/*.webm
**/*.mov
**/*.m4v
**/VID_*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/*-instagram.mp4
**/*.wav
**/*.aiff
**/*.flac
**/audio/
governance/constitution/investigations/assets/phoenix-protest-timeline/*.mkv
governance/constitution/investigations/assets/phoenix-protest-timeline/*-instagram.mp4
governance/constitution/investigations/assets/phoenix-protest-timeline/VID_20200624_110648.mp4
governance/constitution/investigations/assets/phoenix-protest-timeline/VID_20200624_110648-fox10-packup-pause.mp4
governance/constitution/investigations/assets/phoenix-protest-timeline/VID_20200624_110943.mp4

